homed: homed (org.freedesktop.home1 D-Bus service)
homed:
homed: A non-systemd compatibility service for org.freedesktop.home1.
homed: Built using GLib/GIO, Meson, and Polkit, following the hostnamed
homed: project conventions. This initial release supports read-only home
homed: account lookups from the system NSS/passwd database.
homed:
homed: This is not yet a complete systemd-homed replacement and does not
homed: implement encrypted home storage or home activation/management.
